# To Lead and Be Led (Q118), the chosen armor waits for the sponsor: with its armor set chosen (stateEx 1), an apprentice whose sponsor is out of the world is told to bring it; with the sponsor in the world beside it, the NPC names the price of its set.
# Expectations are derived from the reference source (Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed.java, Quest.getSponsor and Quest.getApprentice)
# and the clan mate lines of the scenario format (#4175).
character Pupil 19
clan 3
mate Chief 19 leader sponsor
quest Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed <cond>=3 <state>=STARTED state=2 stateEx=1
script quest.Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed
item 1458 7850 7851 7852 7853 7854 7855 7856 7857 7858 7859 8062 8063
page trainer/30298.htm
page script/quest/Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed/
npc pinter 30298 Trainer 10 0 0

action pinter
action pinter
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=pinter item=0 page=trainer/30298.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{pinter}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=pinter item=0 page=script/quest/Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed/30298-07.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
enter Chief
action pinter
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=pinter item=0 page=trainer/30298.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{pinter}_Quest
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=pinter item=0 page=script/quest/Q118_ToLeadAndBeLed/30298-06.htm
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
